==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (Low-Yield)]] spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Firecracker]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*10 [[Firecracker]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*10 [[Firecracker]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*5 [[One Horn]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
A rather easy stage, just bring any [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|Anti-Red Cats]].  [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Sushi Cat]] is very useful for tanking in this stage while your attackers are able to deal tons of damage to the enemies.

